e there are no safe or  unsafe places  everyone is under threat  i repeat my call to old residents  whenever you hear the sirens go to the  shelters because it might save your life  we mourn those who died but we have to  be vigilant  they are now smashing civilian  infrastructure  more and more will be coming  as russia seems to be shifting its focus  on the ground to eastern ukraine the  rest of the country remains very much  the target of its air power  hamid al jazeera live
 

